<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica July manufacturing output down 2.2 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>SAfrica July manufacturing output down 2.2 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African manufacturing production fell 2.2 percent on a seasonally-adjusted basis in July compared with the same month a year ago, the Central Statistical Service (CSS) said.</p>
<p>Month-on-month, seasonally-adjusted manufacturing production was up 0.3.</p>
<p>Index of the physical volume of manufacturing production</p>
<p>(base 1990=100):</p>
<p>				 Jul '96	 Jun '96	Jul '95</p>
<p>    Seasonally adjusted  102.3	   102.0	  104.6</p>
<p>    Actual		   103.8	   103.0	  106.2</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
